// Development-only. Never packaged or loaded by the production runtime.
// Each former test file remains a private CommonJS logical module so test scope,
// __filename/__dirname semantics, and regression ownership remain intact.
// Production logical source paths are projected directly from the Core/Renderer monoliths
// inside this process so regressions test the real split architecture without a legacy file.
